Third-Party Code Attribution
=============================

The source files in this directory contain code derived from uu-remote-linux
(https://github.com/VallierDev/uu-remote-linux), an unofficial Linux host for
NetEase UU Remote. They implement its cloud login and room signaling, the
CONTROL data-channel protocol and the WebRTC session behavior expected by the
official UU Remote viewers.

