Modifications:
  These files were restructured and modified for One-KVM (2026-10-15): the
  desktop is the KVM HDMI input from the shared encoder, input is delivered
  through One-KVM HID, and credentials are stored in the One-KVM data
  directory. Section 13 of GPL-3.0 and of AGPL-3.0 permits combining them with
  One-KVM; the combined work is distributed under AGPL-3.0.

